  "details": "I would open up the VrChat app on my phone, usually it opens up normally, shows everything correctly and then I am able to boop friends if I need their attention. However, today, I opened the app to bug someone and upon loading it, certain information is not wanting to pop up. Profile icon top right, profile information (not showing VRC+ icon), all of my friends (except discord), and the search feature just not working. Only thing that seems to be working correctly is the home page, showing group instances, live events, recent worlds and certain worlds that are hot/spotlight. I also have deleted, reinstalled, logged out and back in, as well as tried to update stuff on my profile on the web browser, however, it still has not fixed/updated.",
